191111_110615.wav and 191111_110615.txt

A 15 s recording of an FT8 band (12 kHz, 16-bit mono) and WSJT-X's decodes of it, from the test set of
ft8_lib by Kārlis Goba, YL3JG: https://github.com/kgoba/ft8_lib, test/wav/, commit
9fec6ca39886edbf96f4f5e71edc76da5074e871. tests/ft8_test.js decodes it with TeleRig's port of ft8_lib's
decoder (frontend/ft8-decode.js) and compares the result with WSJT-X's.

